static const char *const SL_TEXT_EN[] = {
  "Human requiring assistance located in Sector 47. Beginning emergency rescue protocol.",
  "Hello. I am LUMI. Ship maintenance unit.",
  "I have found someone who did not evacuate. \342\200\246The first in 340 days.",
  "Can you stand\077 Take your time. Correction: please do not take your time.",
  "Checking your vitals first. Excuse me.",
  "Vitals at 10%. Use the medkit ahead of you. Follow my marker.",
  "80%. Pulse 94 and steady. Good. That will walk.",
  "This vessel is not currently fit for living things. The crew are\342\200\246 no longer aboard.",
  "Under Article 7, my duty is to get you off this ship. I open the doors. It is what I am good at.",
  "That passage collapsed 187 days ago. You need not walk to the end \342\200\224 but the record says humans have to see for themselves. Go ahead.",
  "A security locker. It belonged to a crew member. Nobody is left to claim it.",
  "This ship hosts a large population of spider-form organisms. I stopped counting. A gun is only a gun while it is loaded.",
  "Two neutralised. Accuracy acceptable. Human reflexes exceed the record.",
  "The central lobby. Every route crosses here, which is why you will keep coming back. Regrettably.",
  "Querying\342\200\246 surviving crew: zero. Distress beacon failed 340 days. Estimated infestation: 89%. Shall I go on\077 I would not.",
  "Launch bay one\342\200\246 empty. Two\342\200\246 empty. Three, four, five\342\200\246 six. Six is still there.",
  "Good news: one capsule remains. Shall I give you the bad news\077 Launch power is short. Three of its six slots are charged.",
  "Ship records list three standard energy cores remaining. Engine room, maintenance store, cargo hold. For reference, I run on the same standard. Ship-standard parts are convenient.",
  "The plan: you fetch, I open the doors and light the way. \342\200\246They have gone hungry a long time. Stay careful.",
  "To repeat: my duty is to get you off this ship. First destination, the engine room.",
  "The supply store. Take ammunition. There is a shotgun on the rack. At close range it is the honest choice.",
  "That is a collapse zone. It is also where the crew liked to hide supplies. Your call.",
  "Core one, recovered. Every light in this section is going out now. Do not be alarmed \342\200\224 this is expected.",
  "Slot four charged. Two slots remaining.",
  "The ship is switching to emergency mode. The lighting drops section by section and only the red beacons stay. Nothing got worse \342\200\224 you can simply see how bad it was.",
  "This was the mess hall. \342\200\246Past tense.",
  "That one was an adult. Reaching that size takes a great deal of eating. I will say no more.",
  "The west bulkhead has failed open. That is a shortcut. Sometimes the ship falling apart is useful.",
  "Slot five charged. One slot remaining.",
  "Hull inclination 4.7 degrees. It will not affect your walking. It will affect your mood.",
  "One left. The cargo hold. The largest, the darkest, and the most\342\200\246 crowded. My duty is to get you off this ship. We are nearly there.",
  "The medical bay. \342\200\246Let us keep moving. I have nothing to say here.",
  "A rotary cannon. It empties fast. I will not tell you to save your ammunition. You will need it shortly.",
  "Beyond that is decompressed. The door will not open. The cache on this side is intact. I recommend taking it this time.",
  "Recovered. Take the duct down. It drops onto the engine room roof. The landing\342\200\246 I shall trust human knees.",
  "Slot six\342\200\246 stalled at 51%. There is a crack in the core casing. From the fall, I estimate.",
  "Calculating. Launch threshold short by 49%. Ship-standard cores remaining: one. Location\342\200\246 this location. Me.",
  "I will dock my own core. The standard matches. There is no problem.",
  "Ninety seconds from ignition to launch. For reference, when I release door control every bulkhead in the ship opens. It will get loud.",
  "Once docked I cannot move again. My duty is to get you off this ship, and this is the certain way. So my duty ends here.",
  "Get in the capsule. I will count the ninety seconds. Counting is what I am good at.",
  "Ninety\342\200\246 eighty-nine\342\200\246 eighty-eight\342\200\246",
  "You are doing well. Your pulse is fast, but within range.",
  "Twenty\342\200\246 nineteen\342\200\246 board now. Now.",
  "Launch in three. Two. One.",
  "\342\200\246Goodbye. It was good to meet you.",
  "(static) Cabin pulse confirmed. Eighty-four a minute. Steady. \342\200\246That is a relief.",
  "My task ends here. I will recover the last of my power and shut down.",
  "\342\200\246Goodbye. It was good to meet you, crew.",
  "Most of the ship's lighting is dead. Press F for your light when it is dark.",
  "Organisms may be waiting in the dark. I recommend moving with the light on.",
  "The compass at the top of your view points to the objective. The arrival point is marked with a ring.",
  "I will lead. When a fight starts I will move to your side and show your vitals.",
};
